OL,3,GNEWSAUK government approves Jackdaw gas
OL,4,Afield and says production will start
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government has approved
OL,8,Fextraction from the Jackdaw gas field
OL,9,Fin the North Sea
OL,11,FIt says Jackdaw "will start to supply
OL,12,Fgas to British homes and businesses
OL,13,Ffrom as early as the end of this month,
OL,14,Fhelping heat millions of homes and
OL,15,Fprotecting hundreds of jobs"
OL,17,FJackdaw was approved by the
OL,18,FConservative government in 2022, but
OL,19,Fwas delayed by legal challenges from
OL,20,Fenvironmental campaigners - here's a
OL,21,Fbrief history
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
